masculine singular רִיב Micah 6:1 ; Prov 25:9 , רִיבָה Psa 35:1 +, masculine plural רִיבוּ Isa 1:17 ; Hosea 2:4 ; Infinitive absolute רוֺב Judg 11:25 , רֹב Job 40:2 ; רִיב Jer 50:34 (Ges § 73d Kö i. 509 Ba NB 80 ); construct רִיב Isa 3:13 ; Job 9:3 + Judg 21:22 Qr (Kt רוב ), רִב Amos 7:4 ; Prov 25:8 ; Participle רָב Isa 19:20 +; — strive: 1 involving bodily struggle Exod 21:18 (that is, one with another; E); public hostilities, לוֺ רָב יָרָיוּ Deut 33:7 (with) his hands he strove for it , with עִם of Israel, רָב הֲרוֺב Judg 11:25 (|| נִלְחַם ). 2 with words, with ב person Gen 31:36 (E), Exod 17:2 a (J) Judg 6:32 , so (in figurative) Hosea 2:4 compare 2:4 ; often = quarrel , with עִם person, Gen 26:20 ; Exod 17:2 b Num 20:3 (all J), Neh 13:25 ; subject God Job 9:3 ; 13:19 ; 23:6 ; also 40:2 ( עִם of God; on infinitive absolute see Ges § 113ee ), in General Prov 3:30 ; with אֵת person Judg 8:1 ; Neh 5:7 ; 13:11 , 17 , subject ׳י Isa 49:25 (compare I. יָרִיב below), Psa 35:1 (|| לָחַם ); אֵת of ׳י Isa 45:9 (participle one striving ), Num 20:13 (P); with עַל of thing Gen 26:21-22 , absolute = find fault Hosea 4:4 (|| הוֺכִיחַ ). Especially 3 conduct a (legal) case, suit , usually figurative, ׳י subject; Isa 3:13 (|| דִּין ), 57:16 (|| קָצַף ), Psa 103:9 ( נָטַר [ אַף ]), compare בָּאֵשׁ לָרִב קֹרֵא Amos 7:4 ; with accusative of person with whom (unfriendly sense), Job 10:2 ; Isa 27:8 ; with accusative of congnate meaning with verb רִיב in good sense, = take one's part, 1Sam 24:15 (Gi; v. 24:16 van d. H. Baer; || שָׁפַט ), Micah 7:9 ; Jer 50:34 ( אֶתרִֿיבָם יָרִיב רִיב , infinitive construct = infinitive absolute, see above), 51:36 (|| נקם ), Lam 3:58 ; Prov 22:23 ; Psa 43:1 (+ מִגּוֺי ; || שָׁפַט ), 119:154 (+ גָּאַל ), also 74:22 (God, his own cause); + מִיַּד person against whom 1Sam 25:39 (of vengeance); + אֵת person against whom Prov 23:11 , so (without accusative of congnate meaning with verb) Isa 50:8 ; Jer 2:9 (twice in verse); compare הֶהָרִים אֶתֿ Micah 6:1 (II. אֵת 1c ; ᵐ5 πρός , whence We Now אֶלֿ in the presence of , but on אֶל רִיב see 4 ); ׳ר = plead , with ל person for whom Judg 6:31 (3 t. in verse); Job 13:8 , with accusative of person for whom Isa 1:17 , of God 51:22 , compare Deut 33:8 (obscure, see Dr); of human disputes Prov 25:8 , ר ׳רִיבְךָ אֶתרֵֿעֶ֑ךָ 25:9 . 4 = make complaint , with אֶל person unto and against whom Judg 21:22 ; Jer 2:29 ; 12:1 ; Job 33:13 . Hiph`il Participle suffix מריבו 1Sam 2:10 Kt (Qr מְרִיבָיו ), i.e. (those) displaying contention against him ( ׳י ), compare plural construct כֹהֵן כִמְרִיבֵי ועַמְּךָ ְ Hosea 4:4 , obscure; RS Proph. 406 בִי מָרוּ thy people have rebelled against me, O priest ! Beck Wü We GASm הַכֹּהֵן כִּכְמָרָיו וְעַמִּי ( ׳הַכּ as voc., and [by some] joined to 4:5 ); Hermann SK, 1879, 516 {abbrev } הַכּ מְרִיבִי וְעִמְּךָ , compare Oort ( רִיבִי ); Ruben Crit, Rem. on the passage הַכּ כָמוֺךָ ועַמִּי ׳ְ , so Now. — וַיָּרֶכ 1Sam 15:5 see ארב Hiph`il","rootNote":"or רוּב ; a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Sam 2 10","keyReferences":["1Sam 2 10","1Sam 2 10","1Sam 15 5","1Sam 24 16","1Sam 25 39","Amos 7 4","Deut 33 8","Exod 17 2"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":70,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Sam 2 10","book":"1Sam","chapter":2,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מריב/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhrmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 2 10","book":"1Sam","chapter":2,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מְרִיבָ֗י/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVhrmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 15 5","book":"1Sam","chapter":15,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יָּ֖רֶב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vhw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 24 16","book":"1Sam","chapter":24,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/יָרֵ֣ב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Vqj3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 25 39","book":"1Sam","chapter":25,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord